{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Trust & liveness verdicts","anchor":"Trust--liveness-verdicts","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationRecord","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationDepth","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationRejection","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/SpoofVerdict","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/SpoofReason","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRDepthVerdict","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRDepthVerdictDetail","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFaceLivenessDetectorResult","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/InconclusiveReason","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/InvalidFrameReason","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/TrustDecisionPath","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/LivenessFusionTrace","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/RecognitionLatchSnapshot"]}],"metadata":{"title":"VerificationOutcome","symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerificationOutcome","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:5YEOFR19VerificationOutcomeO","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"VerificationOutcome"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerificationOutcome","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A transaction (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustSession\/verify(window:faceWidthEnvelope:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":") observes the live","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session for ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/window","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and ends in exactly one of these. The rule is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fixed: no face acquired is a failure to acquire; a presentation attack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"denial wins over a match; a check that ran but never graded a held","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"genuine second produces no decision (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationRejection\/notGradable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":");","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and only a held-genuine presentation with a match anywhere in the window","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accepts. A face out of frame for the transaction’s face-width envelope","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(too far, too close, cut by an edge) and a liveness CNN with no decided","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verdict yet grade nothing: such a sample breaks a genuine run, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CNN denial read on an out-of-frame face does not count. A face too far","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the envelope is still denied by a TrueDepth flat run confirmed on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the attempt’s own readings, so a photo or a replay held at arm’s length","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is refused. With the liveness CNN on, the genuine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"second starts only once a CNN run has completed after the transaction","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"opened, and a frame the CNN was offered and did not score (no crop, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model failure) breaks it, the next one again starting on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"run completed after that frame: the verdict standing at the press, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through frames the CNN refused, cannot hold it on its own. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"match is earned after the press too: the press takes the recognition","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"latch cold, so only a match the latch reaches inside the window counts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It is bound to the window, not to the held second or to a face.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Hosts take the decision from here, never from per-frame scores. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"laboratory measures this rule; an integration that rebuilds its own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(accepts on one trusted frame, shortens the window, drops a signal)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does not inherit the measured FAR, FRR and IAPAR.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The answer to one verification transaction — the certified decision.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/accept(similarity:)","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/noFace","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/reject(_:similarity:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor"